{"id":"be21a8fefe07593d","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FFree.md","title":"FFree","display":"FFree","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"FFree","parameters":["E","F","R","f","r","x","t"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"FFree"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>E</span><span>F</span><span>R</span><span>f</span><span>r</span><span>x</span><span>t</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：一阶语法与替换。有序参数：<code>E</code>、<code>F</code>、<code>R</code>、<code>f</code>、<code>r</code>、<code>x</code>、<code>t</code>。</p>\n<p>命名变量的自由出现；量词遮蔽同名变量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ FFree E F R f r x t)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists z1288 (@ FFreeProof E F R f r x t z1288))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5cd3998409754bc5\" href=\"?note=5cd3998409754bc5\" title=\"ZFC_FFreeProof\">FFreeProof</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ FFree E F R f r x t)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FFreeProof","status":"resolved","id":"5cd3998409754bc5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FFreeProof|FFreeProof]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":810,"backlinks":[{"id":"b7e69cae674ee491","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FFree|FFree]]"},{"id":"9b5ea01762f1ee08","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_ArSig|ArSig]]；[[ZFC_FFree|FFree]]"},{"id":"4a1c0902ef42ab95","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_FAll|FAll]]；[[ZFC_FEq|FEq]]；[[ZFC_FFm|FFm]]；[[ZFC_FFree|FFree]]；[[ZFC_FSafeSub|FSafeSub]]；[[ZFC_FSig|FSig]]；[[ZFC_FTerm|FTerm]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Node1a1|Node1a1]]；[[ZFC_Node2a2|Node2a2]]；[[ZFC_Num1|Num1]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]"},{"id":"121c26fcb5226b78","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_FFree|FFree]]"},{"id":"8513aea4cdfb45f5","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Empty|Empty]]；[[ZFC_FAll|FAll]]；[[ZFC_FAlpha|FAlpha]]；[[ZFC_FAx|FAx]]；[[ZFC_FFm|FFm]]；[[ZFC_FFree|FFree]]；[[ZFC_Finite|Finite]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Single|Single]]；[[ZFC_Subset|Subset]]；[[ZFC_Union2|Union2]]"},{"id":"3140071195d07bb1","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FAll|FAll]]；[[ZFC_FEq|FEq]]；[[ZFC_FFm|FFm]]；[[ZFC_FFree|FFree]]；[[ZFC_FRel|FRel]]；[[ZFC_FTFree|FTFree]]；[[ZFC_FTSub|FTSub]]；[[ZFC_FTerm|FTerm]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_PNeg|PNeg]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]"},{"id":"53c6f94a73ab3e2c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_FFm|FFm]]；[[ZFC_FFree|FFree]]"